-- Whole-hour, three-quarter-hour and half-hour offsets: the Double
-- range in, the modular clock out.
--zone 0 2026-07-25 13:30
--zone 5.75 2026-07-25 13:30
--zone 12.75 2026-07-25 13:30
--zone -3.5 2026-07-25 01:00
-- Crossing midnight in both directions: the time-of-day wraps
-- (Int mod 1440), the date does not (floored division).
--zone 5.75 2026-07-25 20:30
--zone -8 2026-07-25 04:00
--zone 14 2026-12-31 23:59
--zone -12 2026-01-01 00:00
-- The clock argument is modular too, so an out-of-range hour
-- normalizes instead of failing - wrapping is arithmetic, not a claim.
--zone 0 2026-07-25 25:00
-- clampTo at Double: summer time cannot push the offset past +14.
--zone 5.75 2026-07-25 13:30 --dst
--zone 14 2026-07-25 13:30 --dst
